# Model artifacts. Most of motor_output/ is enormous and regenerable, so only the
# irreplaceable parts are versioned: the LoRA adapters, the banked prediction
# bundles every downstream analysis re-reads, the run logs and manifests, the
# comparison tables and the figures. Ignored below are the full fine-tune
# checkpoints (517 MB each), the probe's cached features, and the oracle dumps
# (~3 min to rebuild with scripts/tools/dump_motor_oracle.py).
motor_output/oracle_*.npz
motor_output/probe/
motor_output/runs/aki-seed*/*.pt
motor_output/runs/smoke-metrics/*.pt
docs/
